{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/clock\/schedule(_:named:_:)"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock","doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"schedule"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","text":"Actor"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"named"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11GnustoClock9TimetableV","text":"Timetable"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","text":"TimedEvent"}],"externalID":"s:11GnustoClock0B0V8schedule_5named_0A010TimedEventVAF5ActorV_SSAA9TimetableVtF","modules":[{"name":"GnustoClock"}],"extendedModule":"GnustoClock","title":"schedule(_:named:_:)"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Puts an actor on a timetable: a daemon that keeps them where their day"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"says they should be."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/schedule(_:named:_:)"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"schedule","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"actor","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","text":"Actor","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Actor"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"named","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"name","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"timetable"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Timetable","preciseIdentifier":"s:11GnustoClock9TimetableV","text":"Timetable"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","text":"TimedEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TimedEvent"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"actor","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Whose day this is."}]}]},{"name":"name","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The daemon’s name, unique across the whole game."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"timetable","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The day to keep."}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The timed event, for the game’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timers"},{"type":"text","text":" block."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This is the deterministic counterpart to ","type":"text"},{"code":"GnustoActors","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"’ ","type":"text"},{"code":"roams","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"announcement discipline is the same — the departure line prints only if","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the player is standing in the room being left, the arrival line only in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the room being entered, and neither in the dark — but nothing here draws","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from the seeded random stream, because a suspect whose movements are a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"coin flip has no alibi worth checking.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Movement is a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"teleport to the scheduled room, with no exit-graph"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"awareness"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": a locked door on the route will not stop him. The contract","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a timetable is keeping is that he ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"is"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" in the study at a quarter past —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not that he plausibly got there.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If the physical journey matters, there are two ways to say so and they","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are not interchangeable:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Make the room he passes through a stop of its own."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" He is really"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"there, so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"location(of:at:)"},{"type":"text","text":" will say so and any testimony read off"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the timetable inherits it. Costs a tick: for him to be "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"seen","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" there"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the stop has to land on a time the clock actually samples, which on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a multi-minute turn means taking one off a neighbouring leg. A stop","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"that falls between two samples is jumped — its ","type":"text"},{"code":"perform:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" still runs,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on the tick that passes it, but nobody watched him arrive or leave.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Say it from the stop that already moves him"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", with a ","type":"text"},{"code":"perform:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"closure and ","type":"text"},{"code":"say(_:from:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" naming the room passed through. The line","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"prints on the same turn as that stop’s own departure and arrival, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in that room only. The timetable does not learn anything — he is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"still a teleport, and a lookup will not place him on the grass — so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"take this one when the crossing is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"narration"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" and the stop times are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"load-bearing elsewhere.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sources\/Fulminate"},{"type":"text","text":" uses both: five actors on stops, and one crossing"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"whose middle leg is a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"perform:"},{"type":"text","text":" line because the minutes on either side"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of it are quoted by a witness."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An actor with no room — ","type":"text"},{"code":"vanish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"ed, shut in a chest, carried off —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"idles: the daemon keeps his place in the day but moves him nowhere and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"runs no stop’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"perform:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so when he is put down again he goes where","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the day says he is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"now"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", and the stops that came round while he was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gone stay unperformed rather than all firing at once. An actor merely"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"moved","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" somewhere off his route, by contrast, walks back on the next"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tick, because a timetable means he goes where he is supposed to be."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To take him off his rounds for good — arrested, murdered, sent away —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"call "},{"code":"stopDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The daemon’s first tick seeds his place from the opening time and runs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nothing: the stop in force when the game opens has not "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"come round","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a 9:00 stop’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"perform:"},{"type":"text","text":" does not fire on turn one of a game that opens"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at half past five."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After that, a tick either "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"walks"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"lands"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", and which one depends"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on the gap since the tick before it. A tick one turn after the last one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"walks: every stop it passed runs its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"perform:"},{"type":"text","text":", in order, wrapping at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"midnight, which is what makes a clock running fifteen minutes to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"turn honest about stops five minutes apart. Any other tick lands — he"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"goes where the day says he is "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"now"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", the stop in force runs, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ones the gap flew over stay unperformed. That is the answer for a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"daemon started again some turns after "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stopDaemon(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", for a clock"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"moved by "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/advance(by:)"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/set(to:)"},{"type":"text","text":", and for a rewind, none of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which mean he spent the interval walking his route. Inside a walk the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"place is written before each "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"perform:"},{"type":"text","text":", so a body that throws leaves"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that stop kept and the next tick picks up at the one after it."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Timer names are global across a game; the convention here is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"<actor>.day\""},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"references":{"doc://GnustoClock/documentation/GnustoClock/Timetable":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Timetable","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/timetable","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An actor’s day, written down: a list of stops the clock walks them through."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Timetable","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Timetable","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Timetable","kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoClock/documentation/GnustoClock/Clock/advance(by:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/clock\/advance(by:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"advance"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"by"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Moves the clock by some minutes without the player spending turns —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for an interlude the prose skips over. Negative values rewind, but an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"alarm that has already fired stays fired."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/advance(by:)","title":"advance(by:)"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/Actor":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/actor","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Actor"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Actor"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A character in the world — a troll, a thief, a parrot."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Actor","title":"Actor"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/TimedEvent":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/timedevent","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"TimedEvent"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"TimedEvent"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A named timed event, declared in a game or bundle "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timers"},{"type":"text","text":" block: a fuse"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(fires once, N turns after it is started) or a daemon (runs at the end of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every turn while active). The body is registered at bootstrap and never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"serialized; only the schedule — name → turns remaining, or the active"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"flag — lives in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WorldState"},{"type":"text","text":", so it saves and restores like any other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state and a restore re-binds it to the declared body by name."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/TimedEvent","title":"TimedEvent"},"doc://GnustoClock/documentation/GnustoClock/Clock":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Clock","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/clock","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A wall clock over the turn counter: a game where it is twenty to six, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ten to six four turns later."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Clock","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Clock","kind":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoClock/documentation/GnustoClock/Clock/schedule(_:named:_:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/clock\/schedule(_:named:_:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"schedule"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Actor","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"named"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Timetable","preciseIdentifier":"s:11GnustoClock9TimetableV"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TimedEvent","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Puts an actor on a timetable: a daemon that keeps them where their day"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"says they should be."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/schedule(_:named:_:)","title":"schedule(_:named:_:)"},"doc://GnustoClock/documentation/GnustoClock/Clock/set(to:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustoclock\/clock\/set(to:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"set","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"to","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11GnustoClock9TimeOfDayV","text":"TimeOfDay","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Moves the clock "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"forward","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to the next occurrence of a time, at or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after now. Setting it to the current time does nothing; setting it to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"an earlier one lands tomorrow, so the day count never runs backwards."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/set(to:)","title":"set(to:)"},"doc://GnustoClock/documentation/GnustoClock":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoclock","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Puts a wall clock over the engine’s turn counter, so a game can be played"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"against an evening rather than a move count.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","title":"GnustoClock","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock"}}}